The CSSconic-gradient()function creates a conic gradient.

A conic gradient is a gradient with color transitions rotated around a center point.

To create a conic gradient you must define at least two colors.

By default,angleis 0deg andpositionis center.

If nodegreeis specified, the colors will be spread equally around 
the center point.

